### Restaurant CMS API (REST Client extension: click "Send Request")
@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1
@tenant = ember-oak

### Sign in as restaurant staff (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@restaurant.local", "password": "ChangeMe!123" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Guest site: menu of one restaurant (no sign-in)
GET {{api}}/public/{{tenant}}/menu

### Guest: table info behind a QR code
GET {{api}}/public/{{tenant}}/tables/T2

### Floor plan with live visit info
GET {{api}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open orders, first page
GET {{api}}/orders?activeOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's dashboard
GET {{api}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Platform (sign in as platform@restaurant.local) ----------
@platformToken = paste-platform-token-here

### All restaurants
GET {{api}}/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Onboard a restaurant
POST {{api}}/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "blue-door", "name": "Blue Door Café", "plan": "Starter",
  "ownerEmail": "owner@bluedoor.test", "ownerName": "Kabir", "ownerPassword": "ChangeMe!123",
  "timeZoneId": "Asia/Kolkata", "currency": "INR", "withSampleData": true
}

### Health
GET http://localhost:5080/health
